Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Institutional desks owe\Neach other in tangled rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle every debt one by one, and\Ncapital stays locked while gas explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,At 44 desks, our hardened Solidity\Nreference burns 16.65 million gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,StylusClear rebuilds the clearing core\Nin no_std Rust on Arbitrum Stylus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The same batch models at 2.92M: 82.5%\Nless gas, while netting away up to 94% of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the cash that has to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Scenario one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Four trading desks owe $13,200 in a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A canonical 2-origin BFS finds\Nboth cycles and nets them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Only $1,050 still has to\Nmove: 92% less liquidity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,plus a 2 WETH batch-auction\Nfill at one uniform price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now push a quote 26% outside the oracle band.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The fail-closed guard reverts\Nwith LimitPriceViolated,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and the entire batch rolls back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing settles halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,On Robinhood Chain Testnet, the same\Nengine nets USDG against tokenized NVDAx:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,$24,000 gross becomes $1,400.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And a dust-collateral sweep means an\Ninsolvent account can always be closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shipping is engineered too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The engine compiles to plain\NWASM 1.0: 24,518 B after Brotli,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,54 B under the classic 24 KiB cap with\Nits header, and zero float opcodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One atomic factory deploys, activates\Nand initializes it in a single
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,transaction, and all 37 methods share\NSolidity-identical reentrancy guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real workbench in Chromium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Each preset re-runs the clearing and\Nmargin math right in the browser,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and the oracle guard blocks the bad quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag the mesh to 64 desks, and the\NBFS still answers in milliseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On the right, the actual 5-stage judge\Ngates on this machine: Rust, Foundry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Z3 and the workbench seam, all green.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Testnet manifests stay empty\Nuntil broadcast. No fake hashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The benchmark is deliberately honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Solidity runs on cold storage slots,\Nand the Stylus model prices every host
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,call, including 20k-gas cold nonce writes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Savings grow with scale: 41% on\Nsmall batches, 82.5% at stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,all under Arbitrum's 32M-gas block cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Six Z3 theorems are proved, and 100\Nfuzzed batches match the compiled Rust
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,binary bit for bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,StylusClear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear more, move less.
